"I agree to receive SMS verification codes and reminder messages I schedule\n      for myself from Flexible Timers by Xintech LLC at this phone number.\n      Standard message and data rates may apply. Reply STOP to opt out and HELP\n      for help. Message frequency varies. Flexible Timers will not send\n      marketing texts. Consent is not a condition of purchase." = "Saya bersetuju menerima kod pengesahan SMS dan mesej peringatan yang saya\n      jadualkan untuk diri sendiri daripada Flexible Timers by Xintech LLC di nombor\n      telefon ini. Kadar mesej dan data standard mungkin dikenakan. Balas STOP\n      untuk menarik diri dan HELP untuk mendapatkan bantuan. Kekerapan mesej\n      berbeza-beza. Flexible Timers tidak akan menghantar mesej pemasaran.\n      Persetujuan bukan syarat pembelian.";
